# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
*.egg-info

# The two interpreters, and the reason there are two.
#
# `.env-venv/` runs the harness: craftax and jax, plus what run.py and act.py
# need. It is the interpreter run.py is launched under, so `act` in a workspace
# inherits it. 776MB, rebuilt by tools/make_env_venv.sh.
#
# `.agent-venv/` is what the workspace's `python` shim points at: numpy and
# Pillow and nothing else, so that `import craftax` from it fails. The world
# generator, the block table and all 67 achievements by name ship inside the
# package — handing over the harness's own interpreter would hand over the
# answer. Rebuilt by tools/make_agent_venv.sh.
.venv
.env-venv/
.agent-venv/

# Secrets — never committed
.env

# Live workspaces, at the root only
/runs/
